WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:04.650
<i>The Duel between Shark and IV has started, full of rage and revenge!</i>

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.100
<i>In order to win, Shark Summoned his Number.</i>

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.050
<i>But, after receiving eight consecutive brutal attacks from IV,</i>

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:11.650
<i>he has fallen onto the field!</i>

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.140
<i>Shark, don't tell me you...</i>

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.130
Shark...

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.330
Shark!

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:19.130
Hey, Shark!

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.030
Get a hold of yourself, Shark!

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:23.210
Astral!

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.300
Can't you do something about this?

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.020
It's useless.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.800
This chain is made by Varian's power.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:35.410
For you, who only has power from the Astral World, it is impossible to untie it.

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:38.580
In that case, we have to defeat you in a Duel, right?

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:40.880
Let's settle the score, Tron!

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:44.040
A Duel? Not right now!

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:47.060
After all, we'll miss this entertaining show!

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.620
You jerk! This kind of thing's useless against my Bring It To 'em!

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:56.510
Bring it to 'em?

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.830
Kazuma had that catchphrase as well.

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:04.120
But he wasn't able to return from the Parallel Worlds.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:10.740
Ryoga, I won't allow you to surrender!

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:13.680
So stand up, Ryoga.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.940
Stand up and come at me!

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:19.970
Let me give you the final and greatest fanservice!

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:26.490
Ryoga...

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:28.870
Ryoga...

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:31.410
Ryoga...

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:33.130
You...

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:35.940
Now is the time to accept me.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:40.340
Become one with me, Ryoga!

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.510
Accept me!

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:46.210
No! I...

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:47.500
I already...

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:49.720
I won't be consumed by the likes of Numbers again!

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:53.580
Hey, Shark...Shark!

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:56.910
Shark...?!

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.790
I... I...

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:02.440
His expression seems a bit strange.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.000
He is suffering!

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:04.540
Huh?!

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:09.060
The Number is trying to manipulate his heart once again!

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:10.200
What?

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:14.370
Accept me...

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:18.700
Accept me, and release the darkness inside your heart!

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.630
If you wish to win, you must accept me!

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:24.690
Become one with me!

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:26.940
No!

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:31.520
No! I... I...

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:38.620
I... definitely won't...

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.900
...be controlled by someone else!

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:49.790
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:55.130
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:11.980
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:17.780
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:22.370
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:28.410
<i>It's too late for us to turn back now</i>

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:33.500
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:39.050
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:44.850
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:49.890
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:55.360
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:03:55.690 --> 00:04:01.030
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:07.200
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:13.290
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.440
My turn! Draw!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:21.530
I activate the Continuous Magic from my hand, Different Dimension Depths!

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:25.200
"Number 58: Shark Awakens!
 A New Chaos Number Appears"

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:24.990
A new Chaos Numbers appears!

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:25.740
It banishes one Water-Attribute Monster on my field!

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:26.620
What?

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:27.740
Banish?!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:32.080
No, it's good. He'll be able to deny the allure of his Number this way.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:38.420
And since it was banished,
 Heaven's Strings' effect is also negated!

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:39.750
I see!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:40.380
Awesome!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.630
You are awesome, Shark!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:45.090
Then I set a new Monster in Face-Down Defense Position.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:49.060
I ...will then...end my turn!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.600
I praise you for that, Ryoga.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.890
I can't believe you actually gave up using Shark Drake.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.440
But now you have just lost your trump.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:03.360
But I still have Heaven's Strings with 3000 Attack Points.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.370
And this Monster is equipped with Destiny Strings.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:12.120
It is capable of attacking consecutively like moments ago.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.290
You no longer have a chance of winning!

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.370
Is that so?

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.800
The Equip Magic, Destiny Strings, comes with great risk.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.010
Tron...

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:29.600
To activate its effects, you must send one card from your deck to the Graveyard.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.520
But it won't work if the drawn card isn't a Monster Card.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:41.520
And, say the card you draw <i>isn't</i> a Monster,

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.900
then you cannot attack, and the battle will end.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:49.740
You drawing all Monsters before was nothing but <i>luck</i>.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.910
You don't trust me?

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.790
I'm just saying it's all just a matter of probability.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.080
I am a scientist, after all.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.830
You've always been like this.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.090
Differing from V and III, who are calm and cautious,

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.920
you are hotblooded, impulsive, and loose your temper easily.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:07.010
Tron!

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:09.390
See? Exactly like I said.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.600
It would serve you best to think this over calmly right now.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.470
If you can even <i>do</i> that, that is...

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.230
It's just as Tron said.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:23.230
Just what would such a risky gamble merit him?

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:27.110
You... You really can't trust me this much?

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.950
Just because I can't become an obedient servant like V and III...

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:36.830
But even so... I still also... for your sake...

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.120
Dad!

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:43.540
Dad, you always smiled gently in the past,

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.670
warmly watching me and my brothers grow.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:48.380
But...

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:54.010
After you returned from the Parallel Worlds, it's like you had an entirely different personality!

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:56.470
You became the grim avenger, Tron.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:59.690
Despite that, we were still willing to follow you, Tron.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.110
That includes incriminating Ryoga with our trap, and even his younger sister...

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.070
Stop pretending to be a victim!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:12.870
Even if you were being used, I still won't forgive what you did!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.330
And I don't plan to run from you!

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.950
I will settle the score with you here and now!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.910
And I will be the winner!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.460
I will be the one to defeat Dr. Faker!

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.420
I will not allow you to assassinate Dr. Faker!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:30.050
Once Dr. Faker is defeated, Tron will return to his normal self...

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.930
Change back to our father, Byron Arklight.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.470
I firmly believe that you are still there!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.770
For your sake, I even did something that cruel!

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:41.980
Even so...

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.020
Even so, I...

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.940
You still don't trust me?!

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:50.490
I will not trust <i>anyone</i> anymore.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:57.620
I can only trust <i>myself</i>, as well as the Varian World!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.540
Because they are the ones who saved me!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.630
Varian...

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:16.640
Which makes me your <i>pawn</i> in the end, huh?

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.270
III became your sacrificial pawn! The same for V!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.890
But I'm not a mere pawn!

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:25.480
I am now the Asian Duel Champion!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:28.270
You can't use me that easily!

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:32.860
My turn! Draw!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:42.620
Screw it! I'll show you I have technique <i>and</i> luck!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:49.880
Here I come! I attack with Heaven's Strings, equipped with the Equip Magic, Destiny Strings!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.800
Is he planning to gamble once again?

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:55.300
I draw one card from my deck and send it to the Graveyard!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:09:00.260
If it's a Monster Card, I can attack up to the number of that Monster's level!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.020
Ryoga, this is your end!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:08.110
Looks like the result is exactly as I suspected.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:11.320
He just drew a Magic or Trap Card.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:15.320
Im...impossible! Why?

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.740
Now IV's battle ends.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.660
But I won't let it end like this!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:27.120
I summon Gimmick Puppet Scissors Arm from my hand!

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.920
By destroying an Equip Card on my field, its level doubles!

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:37.090
I destroy Destiny Strings, the Equip Card equipped to Heaven's Strings!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:43.270
Then Scissor Arm's level becomes eight!

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:44.980
Why?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:45.640
Huh?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.770
If he had that Monster in his hand,

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:52.820
rather than taking the risk of failure, and activating the effect of Destiny Strings,

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:57.660
he should have used Scissors Arm and Heaven's Strings to attack!

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.160
Don't tell me IV misplayed?!

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:06.290
<i>I </i>did<i> suggest that you think calmly.</i>

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.080
<i>Perhaps it was me who lead him to this result?</i>

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:10.960
<i>Either way...</i>

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:14.670
I release Gimmick Puppet Heaven's Strings!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.050
And Special Summon this Monster!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.300
I Special Summon Gimmick Puppet Nightmare!

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:31.520
When Nightmare is Special Summoned by releasing an Xyz Monster, it can be treated as 2 Xyz Materials!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:35.860
I Overlay the Level Eight Scissors Arm and Nightmare, which splits into two!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:43.740
I build the Overlay Network with these three Monsters!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:45.580
Xyz Summon!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.420
Another new Number!

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.210
This is my <i>true</i> trump card!

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.260
Come forth, Number 88!

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.720
Gimmick Puppet Destiny Leo!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.440
3200 Attack Points?!

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:21.200
Such a majestic appearance!

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.410
I activate Destiny Leo's effect!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:30.540
When all of this guy's Overlay Units are detached, I will win this Duel!

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:35.630
Plus, once per turn, it can detach one Overlay Unit to the Graveyard.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:39.880
He can win just by using up its Overlay Units?

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:41.430
Say what?!

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:42.640
That can't be possible!

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:46.760
This is the power of the invincible Number, Destiny Leo!

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.730
Destiny Leo still has one Overlay Unit left.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:55.860
In the next turn, the second Destiny Leo uses its last Xyz Material,

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:58.280
Ryoga, you will lose!

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.660
No way! Shark can't lose like this!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:07.080
With only that Monster in Face-Down Defense Position on Shark's field, he can't defeat a Number.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:11.710
Moreover, its unnecessary for Destiny Leo to conduct battle anyway.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.120
Because in this situation, he already...

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.710
<i>I will lose to IV?</i>

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:21.590
<i>Lose to that IV, who framed me in the Championship, and even got my younger sister injured?</i>

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.090
<i>Am I going to lose like this, without getting my revenge?</i>

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.550
It's too early to give up.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:28.810
Tron!

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.560
You still have a way to win.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:36.440
You are different from IV, because you can think calmly.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.530
Tron! Why are you helping Ryoga?

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.400
You don't want me to win?!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.860
It doesn't really matter if you win.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:51.000
I told you, didn't I? All you have to do is fulfill your role.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:56.210
And you've done <i>superb</i> so far! Pushing Ryoga this far!

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:57.170
Tron...

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:00.050
You can get a nice, long rest after this is over!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.920
Your turn has long ended.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.680
Tron, you...!

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:09.430
Whether it's V, III, or IV, they aren't just tools for your revenge!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:14.520
So, Ryoga, did you manage to find the answer?

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:15.850
You bastard...!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.270
It's okay if you lose.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.480
But you won't be able to take revenge on us if you do.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:24.190
I <i>will</i> get revenge, by any means necessary!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:27.570
Very good. <i>Now</i> we're on the same page.

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:30.870
As expected from the strongest assassin I choose.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.750
Stop kidding! I will not become something like-

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.120
Shark!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:38.710
Th...This is...

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.090
It's the Number!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:43.340
Shark Drake is looking for you.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.760
Recall it.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:51.100
You can do this... Ryoga.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.810
Never!

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.150
I...definitely won't...

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.060
It's calling you...

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.860
Shark Drake...

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.990
... is calling you.

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.110
Never...

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.700
Never...

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:15.370
Defeat IV by combining your strength with Shark Drake!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.410
Never...

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.920
Call it, Ryoga!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:24.090
The only way for you to win is to call back Shark Drake, and integrate yourself with the Number!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.810
Accept the Number, Ryoga.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.720
Then everything will go as you desire!

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:37.640
Everything...

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.650
No! Stop, Shark!

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.650
Everything I... desire...

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.530
Defeat IV...

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.650
Defeat Tron...

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.910
Complete my revenge...

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:52.830
That's right.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.660
Everything will come true.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:00.040
Stop, Shark! Don't do it!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:04.840
<i>Ever since that day, since the day my sister was injured,</i>

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.010
<i>I have given my all to revenge.</i>

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.510
<i>If I can make it come true...</i>

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:14.510
<i>I won't even mind a demon taking over my body.</i>

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:18.730
Shark! No! Don't go there!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.480
I can't lose!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:26.650
I have to win! And I need power to do it!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:38.080
My turn! Draw!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.960
I Flip Summon the Monster in Face-Down Defense Position on my field!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:45.710
I switch Deep Sweeper to Attack Position!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.720
Then I activate Deep Sweeper's Monster Effect!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:54.930
By releasing this card, it destroys the Continuous Magic, Different Dimension Depths!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:58.270
In this moment, the card's effect disappears!

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:01.690
Therefore, Shark Drake returns to the field!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.940
Shark Drake is...

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.320
...revived?

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.150
That's why he set Deep Sweeper on the field!

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:10.490
Impossible!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:15.870
This means he hasn't completely refused the allure of his Number.

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:21.540
Even if Shark Drake has returned, it only has 2800 Attack Points.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:24.250
It can't defeat Destiny Leo with its 3200 Attack Points!

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.050
This is where I will acquire a new power!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.050
What?

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:32.380
In order to complete my revenge, I am willing to accept everything!

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:34.970
Come, Shark Drake!

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:37.930
Accept my wish, and evolve!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.390
Evolve?!

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:43.480
Don't tell me...

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:47.560
Me and Marine Biting Dragon - Shark Drake will...!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.360
Chaos Xyz Change!!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:17.300
Show yourself, Chaos Number 32!

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:26.400
Marine Biting Dragon - Shark Drake Vice!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.990
Shark Drake became a Chaos Number...

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:41.160
Why is he able to trigger the power of Chaos Numbers?!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.960
Good job, Ryoga. Very splendid.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.500
Impossible! Why... Why is this guy...?

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:53.340
I activate Shark Drake Vice's Monster effect!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:58.550
By detaching one Overlay Unit, it Banishes one "Shark" named Monster from my Graveyard!

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.890
I Banish Aero Shark!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:10.270
Then its 1900 Attack Power will be stolen from Destiny Leo!

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:16.360
What?!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.620
Shark Drake Vice, attack Destiny Leo!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:24.370
Depth Chaos Bite!!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.370
Shark... won...

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.290
That was beautiful, Shark.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:06.290
Tron!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.000
Now you are my "friend" as well.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:14.130
No! I obtained this new power in order to defeat you!

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:15.460
Duel with me!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.710
Please save the best for last.

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:21.550
After all, the last Finalist haven't been decided yet!

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.100
Shut up!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.680
Don't get impatient!

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:28.430
Shark!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.230
Yuma Tsukumo.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:34.360
I will see for myself just how useful your Bring It To 'em is.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:41.530
Tron!

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:45.990
Ryoga...

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:51.210
I'm sorry for everything I've done up until now.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:53.670
Cut the bullshit! Why say that <i>now</i>?!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:56.590
I wasn't able to stop Tron.

00:19:58.590 --> 00:19:59.590
So, on that day...

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:05.510
...under Tron's order, I Dueled with your sister,

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.720
and used the card he gave me.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:08.770
What?!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.150
I never intended to do something like that.

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:21.570
But I...

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.200
<i>Tron...! Tron!</i>

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.160
I ended up injuring your sister.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:33.830
Then...

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:36.710
IV was trying to save Shark's sister all along!

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:41.760
I incriminated you, and I hurt your sister.

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.010
I'm responsible for everything.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.970
Hold your grudge against me.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:47.970
Just hate me alone.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.430
But I beg you...

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:52.600
Please save Tron, my father!

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.600
Ryoga,

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:56.980
you'll definitely able to save my father!

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:58.690
IV!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.400
And please tell him...

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.950
...that I'll be waiting for him, along with my brothers.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:09.620
That we're waiting for you to return to your normal self.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:12.790
IV!

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:20.460
Shark! Wait, Shark!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.220
IV... No, not only IV,

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:25.970
V and III are all victims of Tron!

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:27.140
Therefore...

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:31.850
If what he said is all true, then I just have to beat Tron to a pulp with my own hands.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:35.810
If you want to get in my way, Yuma, I will show you no mercy!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:37.020
Shark...

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:45.900
Shark... Even you're trying to get revenge using Dueling...

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:47.990
But no one will become happy that way!

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:50.700
Dueling is... Dueling is...

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:51.450
Yuma...

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.870
Just walk on the path in which you believe.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:58.290
If you are right, you are certain to open your own path.

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:03.130
I will! I'll do it! No matter what path it is, I'll open it!

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:06.550
I'll bring it to 'em!

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:15.480
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:21.110
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:31.780
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:36.080
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:37.330
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:42.670
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:47.880
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:53.220
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:58.850
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:05.360
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:10.820
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:16.120
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:21.710
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:26.920
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:32.470
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:43.810
Finally it's my turn to Duel!

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:45.400
My opponent is that Gauche.

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:48.570
The battle takes place on the Dangerous Canyon Field!

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:50.530
Yuma, why are you hesitating?

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:53.320
So the more they attack, the more their Life will be depleted?

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:56.450
Shut up! I have my own strategy!

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:58.830
You just can't win this Duel.

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:01.080
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:05.590
"A Fierce Fight! Yuma VS Gauche:
 This is My Manly Dueling Soul!"

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:08.130
Am I actually afraid to Duel?

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:12.470
An amazing card just appeared!

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:15.720
Number 88, Gimmick Puppet Destiny Leo!

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:18.930
When all its Overlay Units are gone, you win the game!

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:21.390
What would you do if you only had a little bit of time remaining?

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:23.350
Um, how should I say it...

00:24:23.350 --> 00:24:24.770
Yes, that's all folks.
